            "review_title": "Review at Niêu Ta Restaurant And Lounge",
            "review_text": "Peter K\nRyde, Australia571 contributions\n0\nA hidden gem well worth searching for\nDec 2023 • Couples\nThe dining experience here is probably one of the best we've had in Vietnam. Not the easiest place to find (it is down a side street which is a dead end) but worth the effort.\nThe location is a little way out of the CBD but well within any overnight stays near the airport. \nThe food is excellent. Truly an authentic Vietnamese experience. \nThe staff are wonderful. They explain dishes and are warm and friendly. \nThere's no wine list but they have wines available if you ask, we had a Chilean Cab Sav.\nWe have a couple more nights here and will definitely be going back for at least, one of them.\nRead more\nWritten December 15, 2023",
